<div id="<%= dom_id(comment, :deletion) %>" class="comment-deletion" role="alert">
  <p>Delete this comment? It will show as “[deleted]” and no longer accept replies. Existing replies remain. Its text is retained internally while the post exists.</p>
  <div class="comment-actions">
    <%= button_to "Delete comment", post_comment_path(post, comment), method: :delete %>
    <%= link_to "Cancel", post_path(post, anchor: dom_id(comment)) %>
  </div>
</div>
